WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.261
ALARA means keeping radiation exposure as low as reasonably achievable while still obtaining the necessary diagnostic information.

2
00:00:09.261 --> 00:00:14.709
The three classic protection principles are time, distance, and shielding.

3
00:00:14.709 --> 00:00:26.150
Reduce unnecessary beam-on time, increase distance from the source of scatter, and use appropriate barriers or protective equipment according to policy.
